<title>COLOMBIA: Colombia closes coffee export registrations.</title>
<headline>Colombia closes coffee export registrations.</headline>
<dateline>BOGOTA 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Coffee Growers' Federation told private exporters Monday that it was closing registrations for May/June coffee shipments with immediate effect, industry sources said.</p>
<p>Federation officials could not be reached for immediate comment.</p>
<p>But several exporters told Reuters that they had been formally notified of the move in a statement from the federation.</p>
<p>Registrations for shipments by private exporters in April, May and June were opened by the federation on March 7. ((-- Juan Guillermo Londono, Bogota newsroom, 571 610 7944))</p>
